<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Ekajuk Unicode New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Rod</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rod</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rod</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nwer nyi Rod</para>
  <para style="mt1">Rod</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Naomi abola Rut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Ngare nyi abalamalam jo fili adi, njal jolo go ndi nyi Isreel. Nne awohng jolo go no lohng go Betlehem ji jolo go Juda, a nkal ewe, a abon ebe ba nlum na abal. Bo mehle tahm re bo song lene mmongare ntiil go ejahbe ji Moab. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Nne noo bo jo lung-e re Elimelek, nkal ewe bo jo lung-e re Naomi. Abon ebo ba nlum bo jo lungu bo re, Malon, a Kilion. Bo lohng go nnahb nyi Efrat, bo lene o Betlehem ji Juda. Bo mehle song lene go Moab.<verse eid="RUT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Owo Elimelek nluma Naomi kehm ba kpo, Naomi kehm ba sa, a abon abal ebe ba nlum. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Abon baa kehm ba ko anebkal Moab go elbal, nnenkal noko bo jo lung-e re Opa, noko Rut. Eji bo ma kang o ejum nnya ewubu, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />abon abal ebe, Malon abola Kilion tob ba kpo, Naomi ba sa ntahngtahng, nlum limm, abon limm.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Eji Naomi wuku go Moab re Jehova ebtob ane ebe ka bo nsol alehke, á kehm toobo ebjing a akal abon ebe re bo feere kehnge go ege ejahbe. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Á kehm mehle a akal abon ebe bao na abal go edi ji á jolo no asongo mbang mbang nyi li asongo go ndi nyi Juda.<verse eid="RUT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Owo Naomi kehm bungu tong akal abon bao na abal re, &lt;&lt;Feeren, wahn song kehnge goji babnne ejahne. Nong, Jehova tib-n ndon enye ana ḿ ma tib ane ba ma kpo, a me. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Nong Jehova lim eji wahn lˈbel alum ba ḿ bahke bale, fere ji go egahna ntahk soom.&gt;&gt; Á kehm soro bingi bo, bo lingi wahre wahre, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />bo kehm bungu tong-e re, &lt;&lt;E bahk-a toono rehng goji ane eba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Naomi kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Feeren kehnge abon ebame. Jenji wahnge ḿ bahk-m toono? Anv, m bahk kpe jel na abon ba nluma, bo ji bahke ba jol alum ebahna? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Feeren kehnge abon ebame; me n kul sehng re me n kpe bel nlum nondiki. Li re kpe li nyi m bahke koko nlum, n kehm ba bel nlum lela, kehm ba jel abon ba nlum, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />anv, ḿ bahke siki bo tete bo gbala? Ḿ bahke siki, nlum awohng awohng ń nehm ko tib esi eboa? Eˈee abon ebame. Egame wo ga bib sehnge egahne, tibre ebo bi Jehova bia a, kpˈnoko a name.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Eji bo kpe wuk jia, bo kpe kehme ellingi. Opa kehm bingi nnyehn nlum kehm feere eje. Wo Rut feerem, á sa a nnyehn nlum.<verse eid="RUT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Naomi kehm bungu tong Rut re, &lt;&lt;Nyehne, nfahbwa ebfeere goji ane ebe. Á tob fi song toono asowo ebo. Toon-e wo song kehnge.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="RUT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Rut kehm-e faange re, &lt;&lt;Kam-a kpe kpanne re me n yak-a, afi me ki-a kpe toono. Edi ajehng ajehng ji a fi no, m bahke tob ba, edi ji a bahke jolo, m bahke tob jol o. Ane eba bahke jolo ane ebame, Esowo eba bahke tob jol Esowo ebame. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Edi ji a lˈkpo, owo m bahke tob kpo, bo bahke tob kpa-m kak o. Nong Jehova demm-m, n lˈfere yak-a abo, tohko jol ano elkv ni ni bahk-r yaame. <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Eji Naomi lohko seb kahn re Rut ebyehke ntir enye re á bahk-e toono, á we kpeem kpanne re á feere.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Bo anebkal abal abal kehm soro asi asongo, tete bo ba rehng go Betlehem, eji bo rehnge go Betlehem ejahbe kpee kehm mehle a eyebatahng tib esi ebo. Anebkal kehm kehme elbahbe re, &lt;&lt;Lohko li re Naomi woa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Á kehm tongo bo re, &lt;&lt;Kama wahn kpe lung re, Naomi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft">Ji lohngo re nnyebe yebe</char></note>Jo lung-m wahn re, Mara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft">Ji lohngo re elullul.</char></note>, tibre Esowo bi Gbale Sehng eblim elkpin ebsab aname. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Eji m mehle a tahm, n tahme a ane ebame kpee, anv, Jehova ebfeere a name abo abo. Nˈnan ń kp-m lungu re Naomi? Esowo bi Gbale Sehng bi ma-m lim jia, ye wo ma rod akanya nyaa ba nyed-m.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Ana wo Naomi feere go Moab kehnge go Betlehem a Rut, nnenkal a Moab, nkala mmon ewe no toon-e no ba rehng go Betlehem. Jolo ngare nyi bo ma kehme arasi nya bo kpo lung re bali kiimi.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Rut ba kpiri Boas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Naomi bele ekunu nlum ji bo jo lung-e re Boas, á jolo efangene ji jolo mmon elfvvrv, á lohng go etˈtohngo ji Elimelek.<verse eid="RUT 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Efung abehng Rut nnenkal a Moab kehm bungu tong Naomi re, &lt;&lt;Nong me n song go emahng arasi, song kpiimi arasi toono nne no lˈtaame re me n toon-e.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Naomi kehm bungu tong-e re, &lt;&lt;Song mmon ewame.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Owo á kehm tahme song kehme elkpiimi, jo toono ane ba kpˈkiimi arasi. Ana ejum ba jol me, go egbe ji Boas wo á jo kpiimi arasi, ye ji lohng go etˈtohngo ji Elimelek.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Eji Boas lohngo go Betlehem ba rehng egbe arasi, kehm ba kak ane ba jo kiimi arasi nnyo re, &lt;&lt;Nong Jehova jol a nahne.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Bo tob faang-e re, &lt;&lt;Nong, Jehova fuul-a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boas kehm bahbe ntubesi abakiimi arasi re, &lt;&lt;Mmon no nkal noa no nyehne wo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Ntubesi noo kehm-e faange re, &lt;&lt;Ye wo li ngbahme nyi lohng go Moab, no toono Naomi ba. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Á tong-r efungfu bia re, &lt;Titi, yak-m wahn me n kpiimi arasi toon-n, wahn ji kpˈlimi eltum. Yeblim eltum gbalee bomo efungfu rehng anv, sehngem re, yeb re mmokv ntiil go mmobkpatahk.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Boas kehm tongo Rut re, &lt;&lt;Wuung-m atung mmon ewame, jol a, wo jo kpiimi arasi, ka je go egbe ajehng ajehng jehko. Jo jen toono anebkal, bo ji li alokeltum ebame. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Jo nyehn ana abalimeltum kpˈkiimi asongo, wo jo toono abonse nkal. Me n tong ajangkun re bo kˈlim ntong a na. Ngare anyehng anyehng nyi alahb lˈkor-a, song wo alahb go etu, ma bo ma tuk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Rut kehm soro gong esamahr go ndi, kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Nˈnan m ma-a fili ndon, a ma fere lim nnoobo ana nyia ka-m, ga me njenne nyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boas kehm-e faange re, &lt;&lt;Bo ma-m tong kpee bada anoobo nsol nya a ma lim ka nnyehn nlum wa, bomo ngare nyi nlum ewa kpo no, ana a ma yake nso, a nne, go ejahbe eja kpee ba lene go ellong ane ba a ki nyi bo. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Nong, Jehova tuur-a, nong Jehova ye ji li Esowo bi Isreel, ye ji a ma ba woom-e go elwo tuur-a sahb gbˈgbal ana a ma lim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Rut kehm faange re, &lt;&lt;Nsoo nong me n soro asi jo bel nnoobo go ega esamahr, a ma-m kak eltim, go anoobo alum nya a ma bung a nlokeltum ewa, jol eji n ki bˈbik ana nlokeltum nnenkal ewa na awohng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Ngara nsol alehke, Boas kehm bungu tong-e re, &lt;&lt;Mehl ba ga, ba ko ebred, wo tv go abehne.&gt;&gt;Eji Rut ji go ellong abakiimi arasi, Boas ba ka-e nkohl nyi bo ma wo, á li wohngo sa erik. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Eji Rut kpe feere song kehme arasi kpiimi, Boas kehm tongo ajangkun re, &lt;&lt;Afi jolo re á kpiimi na yel go abim arasi, kana ye gbiingi. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Fuumu na re wahn jo yehke go ebim tuubu go nkpe jo bum-e á jo ba fohko, kana ye sahde.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Rut kpiimi arasi nyao tete rehng elgung. Eji á ba ruumu akpiimi kpiimi arasi nyao nya bo kpo lung re bali, ruru ejum ngbojok. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Á solo tahm a nya go etahk, nnyehn nlum kehm ba nyehn elkohn arasi nya á kpiimi no. Á tob ko erik nsol alehke nyi á li wohngo sa erik, song ka nnyehn nlum go etahk.<verse eid="RUT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Naomi, nnyehn nlum kehm-e bahbe re, &lt;&lt;Nyaa a kpiimi gan lela? Gan wo a limi eltum? Elfuulu bahke jolo ka nne no ma-a nyehn ndon kak-a ebo!&gt;&gt; Rut kehm tongo nnyehn nlum kpee bada nne no á kpˈlimi eltum go ege egbe. Rut bungu tong-e re, &lt;&lt;Nne no n limi eltum go ege egbe lela, bo kpo lung-e re Boas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Naomi kehm bungu tong Rut nkala mmon ewe re, &lt;&lt;Nong Jehova fuul-e! Á ka tiki yake eltibi nnoobo eljini ene a ane ba li go elkpin, a ba ma kpo. Nnenlum noa li nne no li nnea nnahb ewahre, ye wo li nlehkelkv go egahre ebangenahb.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Rut nnenkala Moab kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Á tob tong-m re, &lt;Me n kpe feere jo song lim eltum a alokeltum ebe tete eltum arasi nio mal.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi kehm bungu tong Rut, nkal mmon ewe re, &lt;&lt;Mmon ewame, bahke nobo sehng ka-a re wo jo song toono agbahme nya li alokeltum ebe, tib a lˈje go egbe jindiki, bo bahk-a ma lim ebi ejum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Ano wo Rut jo toono agbahme nya jo loko Boas jo lim eltum arasi nya bo kpo lung bali, a nya bo kpo lung re wid tete mal. Rut tiki lene eji nnyehn nlum.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Ana Rut bele nlum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Efung abehng Naomi, nnyehn nlum kehm bungu tong Rut re, &lt;&lt;Mmon ewame, ngare ebbiingi nyi fuumu re me n seb nlaaga ka-ao, nyi bo bahke jo kpur-a nob nobo? <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Boas ji a jo toono alokeltum ebe ba nkal jo lim eltum, nnea nnahb ewahre wo. Elgung nia, á bahke jo febe nkahr yehke go arasi nya bo kpo lung re bali gona ebud bud. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Wuumu alahb, wo taame akehng ma kpi esˈsvv ji nno, liibi nsol nyi kpˈsahb nˈnob, wo song go ebud bud arasi. Ka lim á kahn re a li o, tete á li nsol alehke mal, fere wo amahm. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Á lˈnoongo, seb kahn edi ji á nong no, ngare nyi á ma lal, wo song gbib mbomo lenng-e akpade fere noongo o. Á bahk-a tongo ji a bahke limi. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Rut kehm-e faange re, &lt;&lt; M bahke limi ajehng ajehng ji a ma-m tong. &gt;&gt; <verse eid="RUT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Rut kehm tahme go ebud bud arasi song lim jang jang ana nnyehn nlum tong-e no re á lim.<verse eid="RUT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Eji Boas ma li nsol kpee mal, fere wo wohngo nˈnob, eyebatahng gbale sehng. Á kehm mehle song noongo go nkpe ebim arasi nyehko jo lal. Rut kehm weele song lenng-e mbomo go akpade noongo o. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Ngare nyi nlum atv ma kul, Boas kehm nehke nyahme seb kahn re nnenkal nong-e go ege nnahberedakpade.<verse eid="RUT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Á kehm-e bahbe re, &lt;&lt;Wo nne awoo?&gt;&gt; Rut kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Me Rut wo, ji li nlokeltum ewa. Konng-m ejang ekpa ewobo eja, tib wo wo li nlehkelkv.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boas kehm-e faange re, &lt;&lt;Jehova fuul-a mmon ewame. Nnoobo eljini ni a ma tib anv ebnob sehnge ni a tibi wuku: A beem toono ajangkun nya li afangene, afi bo ji li akpak. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Mmon ewame, ejum jia ki-a ka elfahle, m bahke limi ejum ajehng ajehng ji a kpˈsebe, tibre nne awohng awohng go ejahbe jia kpˈkahne re a kpi eljini ni nno. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Etingitingi ji re n li nnea nnahb, nnea nnahb noko noa no ga fuumu sehnge me. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Noongo atv maa, efungfu lˈse m bahk-e tongo, lˈfere jol re á bahk-a lehke elkv, ebnob, nong á li-a elkv. Lˈjol re we nehme kor re á li-a elkv, n kpˈnyame tong-a go mbing nyi Jehova re m bahk-a lehke elkv. Noongo a, efungfu tohko se.<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Ano wo Rut noongo go nnahberedakpade nyi Boas tete efungfu se. Á mehle o ngare nyi mmojannge kpeka li, ji nne lˈkˈma liingi nne. Tibre Boas tong-e re, &lt;&lt;Nne awohng awohng kˈkahn re nnenkal ebba a edi ji e kpo ruumu arasi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Boas kehm kpe bung tong-e re, &lt;&lt;Ko egbakesi eja wo ba yal.&gt;&gt; Eji á ma lim ano, á kehm gare ekpingi erukabo arasi ebrakebra nya bo kpo lung re bali, fere rod si-e go esi. Boas kehm tahme kehnge go ejahbe.<verse eid="RUT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Ana Rut feere song rehng goji Naomi, nnyehn nlum, á kehm-e bahbe re, &lt;&lt;Jolo renan mmon ewame?&gt;&gt; Rut kehm-e tongo nsol kpee nyi Boas ma lim ka-e.<verse eid="RUT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Rut kpe bung re, &lt;&lt;Á ka-m ekpingi arasi ebrakebra nya bo kpo lung re bali, fere bung re, &lt;Ka feere abo abo goji nnyehn nlum wa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Owo Naomi kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Bel elkpuumu mmon ewame, wo nyehn ji bahke jolo. Boas nehm tiki bel erekekv tete á lim ejum jia lela.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boas ko Rut go elbal ana ejum elehkelkv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Owo Boas kehm mehle tahm go esi ejahbe song ji go eti mbu ji nfam kpo kono elwane. Eji nne no bahke lehke elkv, no á jo bung ba no,, Boas kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Ba, wo ba ji ga mbi.&gt;&gt; Á kehm bake ba ji.<verse eid="RUT 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Boas koo anebkul nfam na awubu kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Jiin a.&gt;&gt; Bo kehm ba ji. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Owo Boas kehm bungu tong nlehkelkv re, &lt;&lt;Naomi ji kpehna kehnge go Moab kpi erohko ndi ji á bahke gungu ji mmonannee ewahre no bo jo lung-e re Elimelek. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />N gbo ntir re me n ko ejum jia ba go ega alata, ba tong-a re wo gunu go esamahr anebkul, a ane kpee ba jehk a. Lˈjol re a bahke fake, a fak, tohko jol ano tong-m eji n lˈkahn.&gt;&gt; Á kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Nnene go limm no fuumu re á fak sehnge wo, me wo li etoono nne.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">A kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;M bahk-e fake.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Boas kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Efung bi a lˈgunu edi ndi jia go abo nya Naomi, Rut ji li nkalebun no lohng go Moab, a bahk-e koko go elbal, eji mbing nyi nne no ma kpo, a nsol enye bahke sake go ebangenahb.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Eji nlehkelkv wuku jia, á kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;N nehm ma fak, n lˈlim ano, ebangenahb ejame bahke jolo efin efin. Me nehm ma fak, wo song fak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Jolo eljini mahne mahne go Isreel bade elehkelkv, a ejum ayaange re, nne no kpˈfaake ejum elehkelkv ka nne noko, bahke yehke ekpaketa eje ka nne no kpˈkoko. Jia ji ane bahke liingi re woblim ana fuumu no.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Nne no jol lˈli elkv nio kehm bungu tong Boas re, &lt;&lt;Fak antahng.&gt;&gt; Á kehm soro yehke ekpaketa eje ka Boas.<verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Owo Boas kehm bungu tong anebkul nfam, a ane bako kpee re, &lt;&lt;Wahn ba li atianse lela re me n gunu nsol nyi Elimelek, nyi Kilion, a nyi Malon go abo nya Naomi. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Me n tob ko Rut ji lohng go Moab, ye ji jolo nkal no Malon ana nkal ewame, eji mbing nyi Malon, a nsol a nsol enye lˈkˈtan go ge ebangenahb, a ejahbe eje. Wahn ba li atianse lela.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Anebkul, a ane kpee ba ji go eti mbu kehm bungu re, &lt;&lt;Wahr atianse enya nya.&gt;&gt;Nong Jehova lim nnenkal no kpˈbake go ega etahk ana Rasel abola Lea, bo ji limi nfam nyi Isreel kpee. Nong wo gbal go Efrat, bo kahn-a go Betlehem. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Sehng go etˈtohngo ji Jehova ma-a ka, go elwo ni ngbahme nyia, nong ebangenahb eja jol ana ji Peres ji Tema jele ka Juda.<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etˈtohngo ji Boas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Boas kehm rodo Rut, á jol nkal ewe. Eji Boas noongo a ne, Jehova ba lennge ejˈjele eje, á ba sa ela jel mmon no nlum. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Anebkal kehm bungu tong Naomi re, &lt;&lt;Nong ellub jol ka Jehova, ye ji ki-a yake abo abo, á ma-a ka nlehkelkv go ega ebangenahb. Nong bo kahn-e kpee go Isreel. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Á bahke limi elkpin ena nyamme, fere kpur-a ngare nyi a ma kul. Ye wo li mmon no nkala mmon ewa no a kpo sahb kor-e kor, me-e jel. Nkal a mmon ewa noa wo ga nob sehnge abon ba nlum na asehma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Naomi kehm rodo mmon kunu elne go ayo jo kpur-e. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Anebkal ba lene o kehm kehme elbungu re, &lt;&lt;Naomi ebbel mmon no nlum.&gt;&gt; Bo gung-e mbing re Obed, ye wo jolo nde no Jesi, Jesi jol nde no Devid.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Etˈtohngo ji Peres ji a, Peres jolo nde no Hesron, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hesron jol nde no Ram, Ram jol nde no Aminadab <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadab jol nde no Nason, Nason jol nde no Salmon, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salmon jol nde no Boas, Boas jol nde no Obed, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obed jol nde no Jesi, Jesi jol nde no Devid.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>